    "output_unit": "кВт",
    "source": "ASHRAE Handbook—Fundamentals (2021), Psychrometrics: Q = ρ·cp·V̇·ΔT; dry-air design approximation ρ=1.2 kg/m³, cp=1.006 kJ/(kg·K).",
    "version": "ASHRAE 2021 / HVAC Studio 1.0"
  },
